'''Nidhögg''' is the sixth one-handed [[Swords|sword]].

* The primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit. No damage penalty against multiple targets.
* Its secondary attack deals 3x damage with a slightly longer reach.

== Upgrade information ==
Like most Ashlands-tier weapons, the Nidhögg can be upgraded to one of the following three variants using gemstones:

* {{Item link|Nidhögg the Bleeding}} ([[Bloodstone]])
* {{Item link|Nidhögg the Thundering}} ([[Iolite]])
* {{Item link|Nidhögg the Primal}} ([[Jade]])

An upgraded Nidhögg will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using gemstones.

